[14.3645, "o", "  \u001b[2m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m559 facts have no value to check (a length or a structure); make\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[2mverify checks those at their exact place.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;48;2;253;218;36;38;2;21;19;15m PASSED \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mEvery fact is confirmed by two readers.\u001b[22m   \u001b[2m14s\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2meach entry, fact by fact:\u001b[22m  make oracle DETAILS=1\r\n"]
